    "stem": "Diya's kitchen science club mixes the same spoonful of curd starter into a jug of lukewarm milk and into a jug of cold milk. Both jugs sit overnight. Only the lukewarm milk sets into curd; the cold milk may taste a little sour but does not set the same way.\n\nWhich statements correctly explain the results?",
