      "C": "2 and 3 only",
      "D": "1, 2 and 3"
    },
    "statements": [
      {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "Lukewarm milk with starter sets into curd after some hours because the starter microbes work well at that warmth; cold milk with the same starter does not curdle in the same way."
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "text": "Lukewarm milk turns into curd immediately when the starter is mixed in."
